# Android packaging is handled by the Gradle wrapper application in this
# directory (see README.md). The Meson build itself only produces the native
# `libmkxp-z.so` shared library, which the wrapper then bundles into an APK
# together with its dependencies (SDL2, Ruby, OpenAL, ...).
#
# Nothing needs to be installed here; `meson setup` + `ninja` are sufficient to
# build the library for the target ABI.
